[00:30.86]December
[00:34.03]十二月
[00:34.03]Running in the rain
[00:37.88]在雨中奔跑着
[00:37.88]Chasing down those memories of us
[00:41.89]追忆着我们的过往
[00:41.89]Washed away
[00:46.12]回忆被雨水冲刷着
[00:46.12]Do you remember
